---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { CATEGORY_LABELS, CATEGORY_DESCRIPTIONS } from '../consts';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="소개 | VoidSpace0x"
			description="공허 속에 떠 있는 작은 기록 공간, VoidSpace0x."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="reading-container about-page">
			<div class="page-heading">
				<p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THIS SPACE</p>
				<h1>
					공허 속의
					<br />
					작은 기록 공간<span class="heading-dot">.</span>
				</h1>
			</div>
			<div class="prose">
				<p>
					개발하다가 든 생각, 종목을 보다가 든 생각,
					<br />
					그냥 든 생각을 가리지 않고 씁니다.
				</p>
				<p>완성된 답보다, 그때의 생각과 배운 것을 남겨두는 공간입니다.</p>
			</div>
			<section class="about-topics" aria-labelledby="topics-title">
				<h2 id="topics-title">이곳에 남기는 것들</h2>
				{Object.entries(CATEGORY_LABELS).map(([key, label]) => (
					<a
						class="about-topic"
						data-category={key}
						href={`${base}/category/${key}/`}
					>
						<span class="category-badge">{label}</span>
						<span>
							{CATEGORY_DESCRIPTIONS[key as keyof typeof CATEGORY_DESCRIPTIONS]}
						</span>
						<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
					</a>
				))}
			</section>
			<div class="about-contact">
				<span class="orbit-mark" aria-hidden="true">
					<span class="planet"></span>
				</span>
				<p>
					함께 나누고 싶은 생각이 있다면
					<br />글 아래 댓글이나{' '}
					<a
						href="https://github.com/VoidSpace0x"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
					>
						GitHub<span class="sr-only"> (새 탭)</span> ↗
					</a>
					에서 만나요.
				</p>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
